ere, but this API is intended for a class declaration shape such as `{0}`. effect(serviceNotAsClass)":{"category":"Warning","code":377056},"This module reference uses the `{2}` module, the corresponding Effect API is `{0}` from `{1}`. effect(nodeBuiltinImport)":{"category":"Warning","code":377057},"This Effect-able `{0}` value is neither yielded nor assigned to a variable. effect(floatingEffect)":{"category":"Error","code":377058},"Adjusting this layer composition could provide the missing service. effect(missingEffectContext)":{"category":"Error","code":377059},"This layer provides the missing service {0}. effect(missingEffectContext)":{"category":"Error","code":377060},"This code uses the global `fetch` function, HTTP requests are represented through `HttpClient` from `{0}`. effect(globalFetch)":{"category":"Warning","code":377061},"This Effect code calls the global `fetch` function, HTTP requests in Effect code are represented through `HttpClient` from `{0}`. effect(globalFetchInEffect)":{"category":"Warning","code":377063},"This code uses `console.{1}`, the corresponding Effect logging API is `{0}`. effect(globalConsole)":{"category":"Warning","code":377064},"This Effect code uses `console.{1}`, logging in Effect code is represented through `{0}`. effect(globalConsoleInEffect)":{"category":"Warning","code":377065},"This code uses `Date.now()`, time access is represented through `Clock` from Effect. effect(globalDate)":{"category":"Warning","code":377066},"This Effect code uses `Date.now()`, time access in Effect code is represented through `Clock` from Effect. effect(globalDateInEffect)":{"category":"Warning","code":377067},"This code constructs `new Date()`, date values are represented through `DateTime` from Effect. effect(globalDate)":{"category":"Warning","code":377068},"This Effect code constructs `new Date()`, date values in Effect code are represented through `DateTime` from Effect. effect(globalDateInEffect)":{"category":"Warning","code":377069},"This co