e":377086},"This code declares an async function, consider representing this async control flow with Effect values and `Effect.gen`. effect(asyncFunction)":{"category":"Warning","code":377081},"This code reads from `process.env`, environment configuration is represented through `Config` from Effect. effect(processEnv)":{"category":"Warning","code":377076},"This Effect code reads from `process.env`, environment configuration in Effect code is represented through `Config` from Effect. effect(processEnvInEffect)":{"category":"Warning","code":377077},"Parameter `{0}` implicitly has type `any` in `Effect.fn`, `Effect.fnUntraced`, or `Effect.fnUntracedEager`. No parameter type is available from an explicit annotation or contextual function type. effect(effectFnImplicitAny)":{"category":"Error","code":377062},"This generator applies the same inline `Effect.mapError(...)` to every yielded effect. Keep that `Effect.mapError(...)` inline and hoist it once to the generator result: `Effect.gen(...).pipe(Effect.mapError(...))`, or `Effect.fn(function*(){ ... }, Effect.mapError(...))`. effect(redundantMapError)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377088},"This repeated `Effect.mapError(...)` site participates in the hoistable generator-wide mapping. effect(redundantMapError)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377089},"This generator applies `Effect.orDie` to every yielded effect. Hoist it once to the generator result: `Effect.gen(...).pipe(Effect.orDie)`, or `Effect.fn(function*(){ ... }, Effect.orDie)`. effect(redundantOrDie)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377096},"This repeated `Effect.orDie` site participates in the hoistable generator-wide `orDie`. effect(redundantOrDie)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377097},"This `typeof ... .Type` query can be replaced with `{0}`. effect(unnecessaryTypeofType)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377090},"These {0} consecutive `catchTag` transformations can be collapsed into a single `catchTags` call. effect(multipleCatchTag)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377092},"This `catchTag` transformation is part of a consecutive chain that can be collapsed into `catchTags`. effect(multipleCatchTag)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377093},"`Effect.orElseSucceed` expresses the same recovery more directly than `Effect.{0}` followed by `Effect.succeed`. effect(catchToOrElseSucceed)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377095},"This Schema number API accepts `NaN`, `Infinity`, and `-Infinity`. Use `{0}` for finite domain numbers. If non-finite values are intentional, disable this diagnostic for that line. effect(schemaNumber)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377098},"`Effect.{1}` expresses ignored failure more directly than `Effect.{0}` returning `Effect.void`. effect(catchToIgnore)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377099},"`Effect.map` expresses this success-value transformation more directly than `Effect.flatMap` followed by `Effect.succeed`. effect(flatMapToMap)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377100},"Exported function `{0}` has no pipeable overload corresponding to its signature `{1}`. effect(missingPipeableSignature)":{"category":"Warning","code":377101},"Classes extending `Schema.Opaque` must not declare instance members. effect(schemaOpaqueInstanceMember)":{"category":"Error","code":377102},"`Effect.succeed` expresses this constant value more directly than `Effect.sync`. effect(syncToSucceed)":{"category":"Suggestion","code":377103},"Do not use `Schema.Schema.Type<typeof X>` to extract a schema's type. Use `typeof X.Type` instead. effect(preferSchemaTypeProperty)":{"category":"Error","code":377104},"This Vitest callback returns an Effect that Vitest does not run. Use an Effect-aware test API or run the Effect with Effect.runPromise. effect(floatingEffectInVitest)":{"category":"Error","code":377105},"Schema literal values must be finite numbers; `{0}` throws during schema construction. Use a finite literal or model non-finite values with a refined Schema.Number. effect(schemaLiteralNonFinite)":{"category":"Error